
05/02/2002 Jason Levit
Added a directory for station data tables needed by the ARPS verification
package, arpsverif.

8/15/1995
This directory should contain the terrain and surface 
characteristics data used by ARPS. 

However, to reduce the disk usage for each updates of the
source code, the compressed tar file of the data is 
stored in a separate place.

For external users, arps40.data.tar.Z can be obtained from 
directory pub/ARPS of CAPS anonymous FTP account at ftp.caps.ou.edu.

For local users having access to the CAPS IBM cluster, arps40.data.tar.Z 
can be copied from /arps1/ftp/pub/ARPS directory.

For more information, contact arpsuser@ou.edu.
Inforamtion on CAPS and ARPS can also be accessed via
WWW page at www.caps.ou.edu.


